 "meetingPattern": {
  "text": "Regular meetings on the first and third Tuesday of each month at 9:30 a.m. (the rules say first and third Tuesday and Thursday, but the posted calendar uses Tuesdays, with a carry-over day the next morning if needed). Zoning and master-plan (CDMP) meetings about once a month on a Thursday at 9:30 a.m. Committees meet the second week of the month. All in the Commission Chambers, 2nd floor, Stephen P. Clark Center, 111 NW 1st Street, Miami 33128. Meetings end no later than 6:30 p.m.",
  "source": "https://www.miamidade.gov/resources/commission/documents/2026-bcc-calendar.pdf"
 },
